      "SAME_ERROR_3_CONSECUTIVE:reason - same dominant error for 3 rounds",
      "BUDGET_EXHAUSTED - per-round budget consumed all available slots"
    ],
    "no_progress_limit": 3,
    "repeated_plan_limit": 2,
    "repeated_error_limit": 3,
    "cost_limit": "Configured in project_f_runtime_budget.yaml (max_model_calls: 500)",
